🎯 Project Overview

Knowledge Discovery & Internal Search is a web application that helps marketing teams instantly find documents across their organization. The system automatically indexes uploaded files and provides fast, full-text search with intelligent categorization.

🌟 Key Features
📤 Multi-format Upload: Support for TXT, PDF, DOCX files

🔍 Instant Full-Text Search: Powered by Whoosh search engine

🏷️ Auto-Categorization: Automatically classifies documents (Reports, Campaigns, Presentations, etc.)

⚡ Real-time Indexing: Files are searchable immediately after upload

📊 Smart Filtering: Filter search results by category

👁️ Document Preview: See content snippets before downloading

⬇️ One-Click Download: Easy file retrieval

🎨 Modern UI: Clean, responsive design with React

🛠️ Tech Stack
Backend:

Python 3.8+

Flask (Web framework)

Whoosh (Full-text search engine)

PyPDF2 (PDF text extraction)

python-docx (Word document processing)

Frontend:

React 18

Vite (Build tool)

Axios (HTTP client)

Modern CSS with gradients

📋 Prerequisites
Python 3.8 or higher

Node.js 16+ and npm

100MB free disk space

🚀 Installation & Setup
Backend Setup

# Navigate to backend directory
cd backend

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate virtual environment
# On Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# On Mac/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run the Flask server
python app.py
Backend will run on http://localhost:5000

Frontend Setup

# Navigate to frontend directory
cd frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Run development server
npm run dev
Frontend will run on http://localhost:5173

📖 Usage Guide
Upload Documents

Click "Choose File" button

Select a TXT, PDF, or DOCX file

Click "Upload Document"

File is automatically indexed

Search Documents

Type keywords in the search bar

Press Enter or click "Search"

Results appear instantly

Filter Results

Use the sidebar to filter by category

Categories: All, Reports, Campaigns, Presentations, Documentation, General

Download Files

Click "Download" button on any result card

File downloads to your default location